{
  "declaredLength": 6504,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Drat. Did I leave it back at home...?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044007200610074002E0020004400690064002000490020006C00650061007600650020006900740020006200610063006B00200061007400200068006F006D0065002E002E002E003F001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>Ah, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>. Would you mind\nif<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nI<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nasked<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nyou<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nfor<U+0010><U+0001>븀\na<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nfavor?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 21,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On second thought...Ansha may be just the\nperson I need.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F006E0020007300650063006F006E0064002000740068006F0075006700680074002E002E002E0041006E0073006800610020006D006100790020006200650020006A0075007300740020007400680065000A0070006500720073006F006E002000490020006E006500650064002E001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ansha, I was wondering if Hoopa would be able\nto help me with something...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m afraid not!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006D00200061006600720061006900640020006E006F0074002100100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Errr...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045007200720072002E002E002E001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hoopa’s power is not to be misused as anyone’s\npersonal errand service.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But...but don’t you sometimes—?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200750074002E002E002E00620075007400200064006F006E2019007400200079006F007500200073006F006D006500740069006D006500732014003F001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I asked Hoopa to help bring my luggage here from\nRichissime because it would have caused a stir if I<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nhad been seen lugging it through Lumiose myself.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 157
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ll tell you what my dear mama taught me: One\nmustn’t expect others to do their work for them.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I suppose you have a point. I’ve relied a great deal\non <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> and the others.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But sometimes I have to take matters into my own\nhands!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00420075007400200073006F006D006500740069006D00650073002000490020006800610076006500200074006F002000740061006B00650020006D00610074007400650072007300200069006E0074006F0020006D00790020006F0077006E000A00680061006E006400730021001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>Help psych me up for it with a battle,\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>—an<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nall-out<U+0010><U+0001>븀\none!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 13,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BD06000000480065006C00700020007000730079006300680020006D006500200075007000200066006F0072002000690074002000770069007400680020006100200062006100740074006C0065002C000A001000020100000020140061006E00100001BE00000A0061006C006C002D006F0075007400100001BE00000A006F006E00650021001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ll be outside when you’re ready.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006C006C0020006200650020006F0075007400730069006400650020007700680065006E00200079006F0075201900720065002000720065006100640079002E001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hoopa and I will come watch. I’d love to see what\nit’s like when Naveen gets serious!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pi hya hya!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005000690020006800790061002000680079006100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Let’s do this for real, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006500742019007300200064006F0020007400680069007300200066006F00720020007200650061006C002C002000100002010000000021001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You’re on!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F00752019007200650020006F006E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Give me a minute",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00470069007600650020006D0065002000610020006D0069006E0075007400650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "This isn’t just about winning—it’s about seeing\nwhat I’m capable of when I try!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s time for me to test my own mettle...against\none of the strongest Trainers in Lumiose!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I have been looking forward to seeing what\nNaveen’s fine Scrafty can do!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pii hya hya!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006900690020006800790061002000680079006100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You’ve always helped me out, Scrafty. This time,\nI’ll help you shine!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F007520190076006500200061006C0077006100790073002000680065006C0070006500640020006D00650020006F00750074002C00200053006300720061006600740079002E00200054006800690073002000740069006D0065002C000A00492019006C006C002000680065006C007000200079006F00750020007300680069006E00650021001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001A>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Knowing your strength, I had a feeling you’d win\nin the end!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nStill, I’m proud to know I can go toe to toe with\nyou and give you a tough battle.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 151
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You’re both very strong indeed!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F007520190072006500200062006F00740068002000760065007200790020007300740072006F006E006700200069006E0064006500650064002100100002011401A50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But for all your strength, Naveen, you seemed\nreluctant to go back home... May I ask why?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "As happy as I’d be to see my sister...I would really\nprefer not to get another earful from my grandma.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 107
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sorry, Ansha—that must have sounded selfish\nafter how much you’ve been missing your mother.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If seeing your grandmother would really be so\nawful...perhaps it’s all right not to see her?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006800610074003F001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I mean... I just...wouldn’t have expected you to\nsay something like that.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You shouldn’t waste your precious time on things\nyou hate doing.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSpend that time bettering yourself instead.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 116
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If your grandmother accepts you after that,\nwonderful—but if not, you can still be proud!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Zaff.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 5048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005A006100660066002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You agree with Ansha, do you, Scrafty?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 5060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F00750020006100670072006500650020007700690074006800200041006E007300680061002C00200064006F00200079006F0075002C00200053006300720061006600740079003F001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Well, I can always work on finding ways to use\nmy skills to make my little sister smile.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nEven Grandma might appreciate that—she adores\nmy sister.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 153
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’d gladly help! Perhaps I could make your dear\nsister some special donuts.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 5456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m sure eventually your grandmother will ease up\nas she sees the care and kindness you bring!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 5616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Zaff!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 5816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005A00610066006600210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ll choose to believe in my design skills—and that\nsomeday they’ll even change my grandma’s mind!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIt would be nice not having to feel so resentful\ntoward her...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 5828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 169
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Battling you brought me some new confidence,\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 6168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042006100740074006C0069006E006700200079006F0075002000620072006F00750067006800740020006D006500200073006F006D00650020006E0065007700200063006F006E0066006900640065006E00630065002C000A00100002010000000021001000020114000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ll keep on chasing my dreams, sewing needle in\nhand...for my sister’s sake, and for all my friends!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 6280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 106
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Zaff!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 6492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005A00610066006600210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    }
  ],
